OL,3,GNEWSACollapsed airline still owes
OL,4,Agovernment #7.3m
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Jersey government is continuing to
OL,7,Frecover millions of pounds in funds
OL,8,Fowed after an airline went into
OL,9,Fliquidation last year.
OL,11,FBlue Islands announced it had suspended
OL,12,Ftrading and cancelled flights in
OL,13,FNovember 2025, before entering
OL,14,Fliquidation while owing the government
OL,15,F#9.1m.
OL,17,FAs of 30 June, the outstanding balance
OL,18,Fof loans had fallen to #7,382,822
OL,19,Ffollowing receipt of #1,773,706 from
OL,20,Fthe liquidator.
OL,23,APub: 27-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Ch Is NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,444,440,260,160,0,100
