OL,3,GNEWSACollapsed airline still owes
OL,4,Agovernment #7.3m
OL,5,
OL,6,FRevealing the figures in a Finance Law
OL,7,FDelegation Report, the minister for
OL,8,Ftreasury and resources said work was
OL,9,F"continuing to recover further funds
OL,10,Ffrom the defaulted loan holder".
